     Cell[TextData[{"\nMamy nast\:0119puj\:0105c\:0105 funkcj\:0119 produkcji \
Cobba-Douglasa \n", StyleBox["Uwaga: ", FontWeight -> "Bold"], "praca \
oznaczana przez L, produkcja energii En (warto\:015bci N i E to funkcje \
systemowe):"}], "Text", CellChangeTimes -> {{3.980245926032797*^9, 
         3.980245937776352*^9}, 3.980246061142292*^9, {3.980246302432684*^9, 
         3.9802463283935337*^9}, {3.980247124534992*^9, 
         3.9802471258680973*^9}}, ExpressionUUID -> 
       "0f6a0a5a-4a97-8a4a-aef3-42017108d002"], Cell["Step 1 \[LongDash] \
Define the technology. The delayed assignment := tells Wolfram to reconstruct \
Y[t] whenever it is used. This allows later derivatives to act on the \
underlying production expression. The exponents sum to one: scaling all \
inputs by the same factor scales output by that factor.", "Text"], 
     Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"Y", "[", "t", "]"}], ":=", 
         RowBox[{RowBox[{"A", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{RowBox[{"K", "[", "t", "]"}], "^", "\[Alpha]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{RowBox[{"L", "[", "t", "]"}], "^", 
             RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{"1", "-", "\[Alpha]", "-", "\[Nu]"}], 
               ")"}]}], " ", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Ef", "[", "t", "]"}], "^", 
             "\[Nu]"}]}]}]], "Input", CellChangeTimes -> 
       {{3.9802459545156326*^9, 3.9802459675059624*^9}, 
        {3.9802460104170456*^9, 3.9802460118672504*^9}, 
        {3.980246047474972*^9, 3.9802460518218136*^9}, 
